# desc: 심사관이 청구항 요소에 대응시킨 문헌 안의 단락·도면 좌표는? (결손 in-document-locator)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT ?doc ?type ?value ?claimTerm
WHERE {
  VALUES ?type { pa:LocParagraph pa:LocFigure }
  ?link a pa:EvidenceLink ; pa:inDocument ?doc ; pa:locator ?loc .
  ?loc pa:locatorType ?type ; pa:locatorValue ?value .
  OPTIONAL { ?link pa:claimTerm ?claimTerm }
}
ORDER BY ?doc ?type ?value
